      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Simulated nodes and Pods: independent contexts, capacity and lifecycle.\nJMX compiles supported samplers; no JVM or uploaded plugin execution.",
      "originalText": "Simulated nodes and Pods: independent contexts, capacity and lifecycle.\nJMX compiles supported samplers; no JVM or uploaded plugin execution.",
      "rawText": "Simulated nodes and Pods: independent contexts, capacity and lifecycle.\nJMX compiles supported samplers; no JVM or uploaded plugin execution.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "text-0055",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 790,
      "width": 235,
      "height": 95,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 3035,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 4915,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Data artifacts are durable.\nBrowser state is not the\nauthority for runs, policies,\nresources or terminal commands.",
      "originalText": "Data artifacts are durable.\nBrowser state is not the\nauthority for runs, policies,\nresources or terminal commands.",
      "rawText": "Data artifacts are durable.\nBrowser state is not the\nauthority for runs, policies,\nresources or terminal commands.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "text-0056",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 975,
      "width": 1420,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 3072,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 4968,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Blue solid nodes = implemented components / owned artifacts. Green arrows = direct internal calls or persistence.\nBoundary: managed simulation runs inside this process; measured native HTTP reaches only the bundled target.\nExtensions: authenticated remote agents, Kubernetes / SSH providers, JVM JMeter and production HA.",
      "originalText": "Blue solid nodes = implemented components / owned artifacts. Green arrows = direct internal calls or persistence.\nBoundary: managed simulation runs inside this process; measured native HTTP reaches only the bundled target.\nExtensions: authenticated remote agents, Kubernetes / SSH providers, JVM JMeter and production HA.",
      "rawText": "Blue solid nodes = implemented components / owned artifacts. Green arrows = direct internal calls or persistence.\nBoundary: managed simulation runs inside this process; measured native HTTP reaches only the bundled target.\nExtensions: authenticated remote agents, Kubernetes / SSH providers, JVM JMeter and production HA.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
